        "matchup": 2,
        "hook": "BATTLE OF THE BOTTOM FEEDERS",
        "body": "Adi takes it 124.62–116.94 because Andrew won’t even let this man tank in peace. Came into the season a championship favorite, now 0–3 and eyeing the first pick. Starting Stroud over Maye would’ve won it by 0.24… bro named his team Free Wins and has honored that commitment EVERY WEEK.",
