      {
        "matchup": 5,
        "hook": "COMMISH FOR A REASON",
        "body": "Throw me to the wolves. Put my franchise QB on IR. Write me off. Gibbs and Geno still helped me drop a SEASON-HIGH 191.56 on Kartik. Won by 52 with Tet and Likely combining for SIX points. Do I know who’s playing quarterback next week? Absolutely not. Did I need to know to whoop your ass this week? Geno said fck no. I AIN’T WRITE BACK.",
