      {
        "matchup": 3,
        "hook": "CODY WINS… BUT AT WHAT COST",
        "body": "The league’s points leader takes down Pranav 168–153.92 behind Bijan’s 34.3, but apparently the fantasy gods wanted Achane’s ACL as payment. Sacrificing the best Aggie in fantasy to beat Pranav in SEPTEMBER is a crazy price to pay. Cody gets the W, and Bijan just found out he’s covering somebody else’s shifts for the rest of the season.",
